OL,3,GNEWSABlack pudding throwers battle for
OL,4,AWorld title
OL,5,
OL,6,FThrowers hurled black puddings at
OL,7,FYorkshire puddings as they took part in
OL,8,Fthe world championships
OL,10,FHundreds of people cheered on as
OL,11,Fentrants competed in the official Black
OL,12,FPudding Throwing World Championships,
OL,13,Fat The Oak pub in the village of
OL,14,FRamsbottom, Bury.
OL,16,FContestants battled it out to see who
OL,17,Fcould knock as many Yorkshire puddings
OL,18,Foff a 20ft ledge by lobbing traditional
OL,19,Fblood sausages at them.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
